@startuml Ticket_Routing_Sequence_Diagram
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam handwritten false
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam defaultFontStyle bold
skinparam ParticipantFontSize 14
skinparam ParticipantFontStyle bold
skinparam ActorFontSize 14
skinparam ActorFontStyle bold
skinparam SequenceMessageTextFontSize 13
skinparam SequenceMessageTextFontStyle bold
skinparam NoteFontSize 12
skinparam NoteFontStyle bold
skinparam TitleFontSize 18
skinparam TitleFontStyle bold
skinparam ArrowThickness 2
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderThickness 2

title AI Ticket Routing & Resolution - Complete Sequence Flow
autonumber

actor "ITSM System" as ITSM #667eea
participant "API Gateway\n(Kong)" as API #667eea
participant "Ingestion\nService" as Ingest #14b8a6
database "PostgreSQL\n+ pgvector" as DB #6b7280
participant "Embedding\nService" as Embed #8b5cf6
participant "Classifier\nAgent" as Classifier #f59e0b
participant "RAG Resolver\nAgent" as RAG #ef4444
participant "Mistral-7B\n(Ollama)" as LLM #ec4899
participant "Evaluator\nAgent" as Evaluator #10b981
participant "Routing\nLogic" as Router #6366f1
actor "UserProxy/\nHuman" as User #059669

== Ticket Ingestion (Synchronous - 440ms) ==

ITSM -> API: POST /api/v1/tickets/ingest
activate API #667eea
note right: < 50ms

API -> API: Validate schema\nAuthenticate (OAuth 2.0 + JWT)
API -> Ingest: Forward validated ticket
activate Ingest #14b8a6

Ingest -> Ingest: PII detection (Presidio)\nDetect: EMAIL, PHONE, SSN, NAMES
note right: < 150ms

Ingest -> Ingest: Deduplication check\n(MD5 hash + embedding similarity)
note right: < 50ms

Ingest -> DB: INSERT INTO tickets\n(title, description, category, priority, status='new')
activate DB #6b7280
note right: < 10ms
DB --> Ingest: ticket_id, created_at
deactivate DB

Ingest -> Embed: generate_embedding(ticket_id)
activate Embed #8b5cf6
note right: Background task

Embed -> Embed: all-MiniLM-L6-v2.encode()\nGenerate 384-dim vector
note right: < 50ms

Embed -> DB: INSERT INTO ticket_embeddings\n(ticket_id, embedding, model_version)
activate DB #6b7280
note right: < 20ms
DB --> Embed: embedding_id
deactivate DB
deactivate Embed

Ingest -> Classifier: classify_ticket(ticket_id)
activate Classifier #f59e0b

Classifier -> DB: SELECT embedding FROM ticket_embeddings\nWHERE ticket_id = ?
activate DB #6b7280
DB --> Classifier: embedding_vector[384]
deactivate DB

Classifier -> Classifier: Fine-tuned model prediction\nCategories: 6 or 24 (variant)\nOutput: {category, confidence, is_multi_domain}
note right: < 100ms

Classifier -> DB: INSERT INTO classifications\n(ticket_id, predicted_category, confidence)
activate DB #6b7280
note right: < 10ms
DB --> Classifier: classification_id
deactivate DB

Classifier --> Ingest: {category, confidence, is_multi_domain}
deactivate Classifier

Ingest --> API: {ticket_id, status: "classified",\nconfidence, category}
deactivate Ingest

API --> ITSM: 201 Created\n{ticket_id, estimated_resolution_time}
deactivate API

note over Classifier, User: **Async Agent Workflow (AutoGen GroupChat) - 4.5 seconds**

== RAG Retrieval & Resolution Generation ==

Classifier -> RAG: ticket_classified(ticket_id, category, confidence)
activate RAG #ef4444

RAG -> DB: -- Hybrid Retrieval (70% Dense + 30% BM25) --\nSELECT t.*, r.resolution_text,\n  1 - (e.embedding <=> query_embedding) AS similarity\nFROM tickets t\nJOIN ticket_embeddings e ON t.id = e.ticket_id\nJOIN resolutions r ON t.id = r.ticket_id\nWHERE t.category = ? AND t.status = 'resolved'\nORDER BY similarity DESC LIMIT 10
activate DB #6b7280
note right: < 500ms\n(pgvector IVFFlat index)
DB --> RAG: top_10_similar_tickets[]
deactivate DB

RAG -> RAG: MMR Reranking (λ=0.7)\nMaximize relevance, minimize redundancy\nReduce to top-5 diverse results

RAG -> LLM: generate_resolution(\n  ticket=current_ticket,\n  similar_tickets=top_5,\n  category=predicted_category\n)
activate LLM #ec4899

LLM -> LLM: Mistral-7B-Instruct inference\nPrompt engineering:\n- System: "You are an expert IT support engineer"\n- Context: Similar ticket resolutions\n- Task: Generate 3-5 numbered resolution steps
note right: < 3000ms\n(GPU inference)

LLM --> RAG: resolution_steps[]\n[\n  "1. Check VPN concentrator logs...",\n  "2. Verify SSL certificate validity...",\n  "3. Update VPN client to v2.5.3...",\n  "4. Test connection with keep-alive=300s"\n]
deactivate LLM

RAG -> DB: INSERT INTO resolutions\n(ticket_id, resolution_text, resolution_steps, created_by='auto')
activate DB #6b7280
note right: < 10ms
DB --> RAG: resolution_id
deactivate DB

RAG -> Evaluator: evaluate_resolution(resolution_id)
deactivate RAG

== LLM-as-Judge Evaluation ==

activate Evaluator #10b981

Evaluator -> LLM: score_resolution(\n  resolution_id,\n  criteria=['relevance', 'completeness', 'actionability']\n)
activate LLM #ec4899

LLM -> LLM: LLM-as-judge scoring (1-5 scale)\n- Relevance: Does it address the ticket?\n- Completeness: Are all steps included?\n- Actionability: Can L1 agent execute it?
note right: < 1000ms

LLM --> Evaluator: {\n  relevance_score: 4,\n  completeness_score: 5,\n  actionability_score: 4,\n  avg_score: 4.33\n}
deactivate LLM

Evaluator -> DB: INSERT INTO llm_evaluations\n(resolution_id, relevance_score, completeness_score, actionability_score)
activate DB #6b7280
note right: < 10ms
DB --> Evaluator: evaluation_id
deactivate DB

Evaluator -> Router: make_routing_decision(\n  ticket_id,\n  confidence=0.87,\n  avg_score=4.33\n)
deactivate Evaluator

== Confidence-Based Routing Decision ==

activate Router #6366f1

Router -> Router: Routing logic:\nIF confidence > 0.85 AND avg_score >= 3.5:\n  path = AUTO_RESOLVED\nELSE IF confidence >= 0.60:\n  path = ASSIGNED\nELSE:\n  path = ESCALATED
note right: < 10ms

alt Confidence > 0.85 AND avg_score >= 3.5 [AUTO-RESOLVE PATH - Target: 25%]
    
    Router -> User: present_auto_resolution(\n  ticket_id,\n  resolution_steps,\n  confidence=0.87\n)
    activate User #059669
    note right: Human review required
    
    User --> Router: user_confirmation = True
    deactivate User
    
    Router -> DB: UPDATE tickets\nSET status='auto_resolved', resolved_at=NOW()\nWHERE id = ?
    activate DB #6b7280
    DB --> Router: rows_affected=1
    deactivate DB
    
    Router -> DB: INSERT INTO routing_history\n(ticket_id, routing_path='auto_resolved',\n confidence_score=0.87, decision_reason='High confidence + High LLM score')
    activate DB #6b7280
    DB --> Router: history_id
    deactivate DB
    
    Router -> ITSM: webhook_notify(\n  event='ticket.closed',\n  ticket_id,\n  resolution_method='auto'\n)
    
else Confidence 0.60-0.85 [DEPARTMENT ROUTE - Target: 60-70%]
    
    Router -> User: assign_to_department(\n  ticket_id,\n  department=predicted_category,\n  suggested_resolution=resolution_steps\n)
    activate User #059669
    note right: L1/L2 agent review
    
    Router -> DB: UPDATE tickets\nSET status='assigned', assigned_to=department_id\nWHERE id = ?
    activate DB #6b7280
    DB --> Router: rows_affected=1
    deactivate DB
    
    Router -> DB: INSERT INTO routing_history\n(ticket_id, routing_path='assigned',\n confidence_score=0.72)
    activate DB #6b7280
    DB --> Router: history_id
    deactivate DB
    
    Router --> User: Email + Slack notification\n"New ticket assigned: TKT-0123"
    deactivate User
    
else Confidence < 0.60 OR is_multi_domain [ESCALATE - Target: 5-15%]
    
    Router -> User: escalate_to_specialist(\n  ticket_id,\n  context_package={\n    ticket, classification,\n    similar_tickets, attempted_resolution\n  }\n)
    activate User #059669
    note right: L2/L3 specialist
    
    Router -> DB: UPDATE tickets\nSET status='escalated', priority='high'\nWHERE id = ?
    activate DB #6b7280
    DB --> Router: rows_affected=1
    deactivate DB
    
    Router -> DB: INSERT INTO routing_history\n(ticket_id, routing_path='escalated',\n confidence_score=0.45, decision_reason='Low confidence')
    activate DB #6b7280
    DB --> Router: history_id
    deactivate DB
    
    Router --> User: URGENT notification\n"Escalated ticket requires specialist"
    deactivate User
    
end

deactivate Router

== Feedback Loop (Active Learning) ==

User -> DB: submit_feedback(\n  resolution_id,\n  feedback_type='accepted',\n  rating=5,\n  comments='Resolved the issue'\n)
activate DB #6b7280
note right: Human provides feedback

DB -> DB: INSERT INTO resolution_feedback\n(resolution_id, feedback_type, rating, reviewed_by)

alt Feedback = 'accepted'
    
    DB -> Embed: trigger_kb_update(resolution_id)
    activate Embed #8b5cf6
    
    Embed -> DB: SELECT ticket.*, resolution.*\nFROM tickets t JOIN resolutions r\nWHERE r.id = resolution_id
    DB --> Embed: ticket_resolution_pair
    
    Embed -> Embed: Re-embed accepted resolution\ntext = f"{title}. {description}. Resolution: {steps}"\nembedding = all-MiniLM-L6-v2.encode(text)
    note right: Knowledge base grows!
    
    Embed -> DB: UPDATE ticket_embeddings\nSET embedding = new_embedding\nWHERE ticket_id = ?
    DB --> Embed: rows_affected=1
    
    Embed -> DB: UPDATE tickets\nSET status='resolved', resolved_at=NOW()
    DB --> Embed: rows_affected=1
    
    deactivate Embed
    
    note over DB: **Active Learning:**\nAccepted resolutions improve\nfuture RAG retrieval quality
    
end

deactivate DB

note over ITSM, User
  **Performance Summary:**
  - Ingestion to API Response: < 440ms
  - Total System Processing: < 5 seconds
  - Auto-Resolve Rate Target: ≥ 25%
  - Department Route Target: 60-70%
  - Escalation Accuracy Target: ≥ 90%
end note

@enduml
